Folded in the Notifier half, since `notifier.notification_logger_listener` had the identical unconditional registration and `NotificationAssertionsTrait` reads it directly too. Same shape for both, with the gating factored into one loop.

Also fixed a real fabbot finding of mine from the previous push: php-cs-fixer wanted `static` on a closure that does not use `$this`. That one was legitimate, unlike the exception-message check.

One thing I did not change, worth a look separately: `NotificationLoggerListener` implements `ResetInterface` but `notifier.php` never tags it `kernel.reset`, while the mailer listener is tagged. So even with the profiler it accumulates across requests in a worker-mode process. Adding the tag would make notifier assertions see only the last request, matching mailer, so it is a behaviour change rather than a plain fix.

